<title>FINLAND: MARTELA 1996 PROFIT FALLS TO FIM 26.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>MARTELA 1996 PROFIT FALLS TO FIM 26.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extras, tax		     26.1 vs 50.1</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		    7.3 vs 18.2</p>
<p> Net sales					  606.0 vs 548.5</p>
<p> Operating profit				  34.3 vs 58.9</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (pct)		  40.0 vs 40.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish office furniture maker is</p>
<p>Martela Oy.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
